# name: STONE
round STONE {wood: stone; pith: round; rings: 9; rules after: [4, 7]; axis 90}
  I
    r1/1  0: STONEFOLK*
    r2/1  0: LONE    4: DEEP+SQUARE
    r2/2  4: RISE{still}
    r3/1  0: BREAK    4: BLOOD+SAIL
    r3/2  0: >LIE
    r4/1  4: CARVE+HAND    6: STONEFOLK#1
    r4/2  6: STONEFOLK×3
  ‖
  II
    r5/1  4: EYE    8: HULL×3{all}
    r6/1  4: HOLD    8: TREE×3
    r7/1  4: CARVE    8: US+HOLD{most}
  ‖
  III
    r8/1  0: HOMESTONE    1: BLOOD×3    2: KNEEL    3: OPEN+DOOR      band STILL files 4–4
    r9/1  0: STONEFOLK×3+RISE    8: US×3+RISE
